  ('7ab06145-47e1-5f49-bf5b-e1cfba7eb9d3'::uuid, 'a669d32d-80ab-5f35-b362-78fa61813cfe'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Generally speaking, the size of an animal is directly proportional to the thickness of its hair.', TRUE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('a66d14b5-02bb-57f0-9f31-b02f61c8a2d1'::uuid, 'a669d32d-80ab-5f35-b362-78fa61813cfe'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Cats have thicker hairs than elephants.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('2568108a-9440-53af-813e-e27b209779dc'::uuid, 'a669d32d-80ab-5f35-b362-78fa61813cfe'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The function of hairs is to protect the body.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('cb3f8ab2-2e3a-5d33-be00-8a88c4211aba'::uuid, 'a669d32d-80ab-5f35-b362-78fa61813cfe'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Different species have different hair thickness.', TRUE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('062f1118-5d6e-5646-b06d-9af0069c6267'::uuid, 'a669d32d-80ab-5f35-b362-78fa61813cfe'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The thick hairs on giraffes, elephants are stronger than small animals.', FALSE, 4, NULL, NULL),
  ('4c951a90-3cae-535a-8b70-74956054fc9f'::uuid, '08b66a8c-2367-5712-9330-8cb4dbd10f48'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'To enjoy a harmonious union with someone, we should ensure that we spend enough time with him or her. Also, whenever we have problems, we need to go to our best friend for support.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('c7b20b93-2951-56e0-93c4-dcc5817f1de8'::uuid, '08b66a8c-2367-5712-9330-8cb4dbd10f48'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The chance of survival and fulfillment of a relationship will be great, if we can survive without it. When we stop believing that love alone can save us, we will truly give love a chance.', TRUE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('cffc6af1-e245-5536-abb9-bd9b2a43ec2b'::uuid, '08b66a8c-2367-5712-9330-8cb4dbd10f48'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'The demand that another person helps us with alarming and wearing things in our lives may not destroy a relationship. However, we are not encouraged to seek for help every time.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('32aecc17-b1e7-5c71-9caa-abed00ca23c3'::uuid, '08b66a8c-2367-5712-9330-8cb4dbd10f48'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Our conflicts and disappointments will at once feel more manageable when we ask our partners to support us. If they are not able to help us anymore, the relationship will be immediately broken.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('40504807-9229-5e15-83b3-d10f540622f6'::uuid, 'b7e0f45c-bcb4-50a1-8d08-706cc2e695e5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'There are fewer Great White sharks in Australian waters than was once believed. This is because tagging has shown that sharks travel considerable distances, and a shark recorded east of Bass Strait one week is often recorded west of Bass Strait the next. However, sharks always return to their place of origin to breed.', FALSE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('5e67591b-af1e-50c5-889f-8246f7581fab'::uuid, 'b7e0f45c-bcb4-50a1-8d08-706cc2e695e5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'A recent research study has shown that Australian Great White shark populations have remained surprisingly distinct as, despite traveling long distances. these sharks do not breed away from their original areas. This means that local shark habitats may have a greater effect on sharks than has been believed up to now.', TRUE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('6bffec7d-0743-5382-a8a1-1b3cf0a864e9'::uuid, 'b7e0f45c-bcb4-50a1-8d08-706cc2e695e5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'There is a greater variety in the Great White shark populations in Australian waters than was previously thought to be the case. This means that some types of shark are actually more endangered than was believed. Scientists are therefore developing conservation programs which will help to protect these threatened species.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('bcc22fa6-3d77-52cb-a226-1a8f56835462'::uuid, 'b7e0f45c-bcb4-50a1-8d08-706cc2e695e5'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'An investigation of Great White sharks in Australian waters has come up with some unexpected conclusions. as it found that the genetic make-up of sharks in one area was quite distinct from those found elsewhere. This made scientists realize that sharks do not swim as far away from their home areas as used to be thought.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
  ('6a957f78-e89b-53ac-9d26-63fe803a2512'::uuid, 'f34c8154-5c7a-5e9d-b75c-1e36555aeaef'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Romance can be a part of a relationship, but it’s not everything. Healthy communication, equality and trust are all very important in a relationship.', TRUE, 0, NULL, NULL),
  ('440db00e-1082-5c3d-9da9-0d679fd73dd0'::uuid, 'f34c8154-5c7a-5e9d-b75c-1e36555aeaef'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Romance can signify a lot of passion, but people will eventually get tired in a relationship, especially when it has lasted for a long time. So it’s important that we should always find something new, to make the relationship fresh.', FALSE, 1, NULL, NULL),
  ('d6cb1e58-efa0-5a0e-9aac-71b53de8a82f'::uuid, 'f34c8154-5c7a-5e9d-b75c-1e36555aeaef'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Romance consists of many things, including communication, equality and trust. Without these great characteristics, romance cannot survive within a relationship.', FALSE, 2, NULL, NULL),
  ('df5148a9-24b2-5aad-9c68-e2e1c065e9d4'::uuid, 'f34c8154-5c7a-5e9d-b75c-1e36555aeaef'::uuid, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-10-06 00:00:00+00', FALSE, E'Romance mainly exists in the movies, and we don’t often see it in our daily life. This is because it can cause more chaos and instability than passion, which is not healthy for a relationship.', FALSE, 3, NULL, NULL),
